    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_request" kindref="compound">TSARequest</ref> — RFC 3161 Time-Stamp Request parameters.</para>
<para>The caller provides either raw data (data_is_hash = false) or a pre-computed digest (data_is_hash = true). All other fields are optional and default to the values in the <ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_config" kindref="compound">TSAConfig</ref> passed to <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1security_1a56f1dbf1678ae2ea986942063fc8c9c2" kindref="member">createTSAClient()</ref>. </para>
